From 53a45002e58b04d3e13447e20d4eba61af120b6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=E6=99=9A=E5=87=9DW4nN1ng?= <wn2276519232@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:55:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add per user bio history to the user dialog

VRCX already wrote every detected bio change into the feed_bio table but
only surfaced it as a global feed stream, so a player profile could never
answer "what did their bio say before?".

The Info tab now shows the previous bio directly under the current one and
a new Bio History dialog lists every recorded change with a word level diff
and the time it was seen. Recording no longer skips the transitions to and
from an empty bio, which previously dropped the first bio and cleared bios.

formatDifference moves to shared/utils/base/diff.js so the feed and the new
dialog share one implementation, and its marker classes move to globals.css.
